{0 soundml-io}

Audio-file input and output for {{:../soundml/index.html}SoundML}, on
libsndfile: decode any supported container to an [Nx] tensor, encode one
back, stream through a bounded-memory {!Soundml_io.Reader}, and fuse
resampling into the read. Headerless PCM — a microphone piped from sox or
ffmpeg — decodes and encodes through {!Soundml_io.Raw}, chunk by chunk into a
pipeline stream.

The entry point is {!Soundml_io}.
